      "description": "The ancestral world of the Vesk and Madrosarai is externally airless and plated with radiator fields, armored access structures, transit conduits, and orbital defenses. Its population lives across the inner surface of the reinforced crust inside Kharosai, where a maintained atmosphere, overlapping gravity projectors, and the Sunlock preserve a civilization built inside the consequences of the Rupture Wars.",
